# Text shortcuts (org.gnome.shell.extensions.amethystora-ui.typing): the switch, then the list of them, which holds the
# abbreviations and how many lines each text has, never a text: the window reads a text with show when Edit is pressed,
# and hands a new one to add on its stdin, never as an argument other accounts could read in the process list
